    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "The correlation length diverges at $T_c$. At $T = 2.3$, just above it, the correlation length is already comparable to the lattice, and clusters of both signs appear at many sizes. The pattern also changes slowly here, because Metropolis dynamics slows down near $T_c$.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
